Which agent file should I use?
- Root AGENTS.md configures this repository.
- Do not copy root AGENTS.md blindly into your project.
- Copy templates/AGENTS.md as AGENTS.md for your own project.

Memory Bank:
- Read README.md, AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md, PROJECT_MAP.md and AUDIT_BACKLOG.md when relevant.

Token-aware discovery:
- Before broad edits, produce an evidence map first.

Stop Conditions:
- Pause on cross-layer changes, auth, payments, migrations, CI/CD edits or wide diffs.
